                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "During the process of gastrulation, the three germ layers are formed from the epiblast cells. The ectoderm is formed from the remaining epiblast cells after the formation of the mesoderm and endoderm. The mesoderm is formed from the cells that migrate through the primitive streak and lie between the ectoderm and endoderm. The endoderm is formed from the cells that displace the hypoblast cells.\n\nSo, the correct answer is:\n\nA) Epiblast only",
