                        "cot": "The question is asking for the false statement regarding the calculation of HDI. \n\nA) In gross enrolment, only secondary education is considered, not primary education - This statement is true. \n\nB) 1/3rd weightage is given to adult literacy - This statement is true. \n\nC) 2/3`dweightage is given to gross enrolment - This statement is true. \n\nD) Country's achievement is computed on the basis of adult literacy - This statement is false. The country's achievement is computed based on three factors: life expectancy at birth, education (measured by gross enrolment ratio and adult literacy rate), and income (measured by Gross National Income per capita). \n\nTherefore, the false statement regarding the calculation of HDI is D) Country's achievement is computed on the basis of adult literacy.",
