                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "What is the purpose of the statistical 'Q' test?\n\nTo clarify, what is the statistical 'Q' test used for?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n\n1. The statistical 'Q' test is a commonly used statistical test.\n2. It is used to identify outliers in a dataset.\n3. Outliers are data points that are significantly different from the rest of the data.\n4. The 'Q' test compares the size of the difference between a data point and the rest of the data to the expected size of the difference based on the distribution of the data.\n5. If the difference is larger than expected, the data point is considered an outlier.\n\nAnswer: B) To determine outliers.",
