                        "cot": "\n\n1. Calculate the net filtration pressure: \n\nNet filtration pressure = capillary hydrostatic pressure - interstitial hydrostatic pressure - capillary oncotic pressure + interstitial oncotic pressure \n\nNFP = 25 - 2 - capillary oncotic pressure + 7 \n\nNFP = 30 - capillary oncotic pressure \n\nNFP = 3 \n\n2. Solve for capillary oncotic pressure: \n\n30 - capillary oncotic pressure = 3 \n\ncapillary oncotic pressure = 27 \n\nTherefore, the answer is D) 27.",
