            {
                "id": "26dd7eda-3dde-43f0-a734-392796fdc8e2",
                "ref_id": "",
                "question": "Which inflammatory mediator involve in intracellular killing of microbes?",
                "type": "multiplechoice",
                "choices": [
                    "Catalase",
                    "Oxidase",
                    "Lysozyme",
                    "IL6"
                ],
                "context": "",
                "cot": [
                    "The killing of microbes and the destruction of ingested materials are accomplished by reactive oxygen species (ROS, also called reactive oxygen intermediates), reactive nitrogen species, mainly derived from nitric oxide (NO), and lysosomal enzymes.\nNeutrophils and monocytes contain granules packed with enzymes and anti-microbial proteins that degrade microbes and dead tissues and may contribute to tissue damage. These granules are actively secretory and thus distinct from classical lysosomes.\u00a0\nNeutrophils have two main types of granules:\n\nThe smaller specific (or secondary) granules contain lysozyme, collagenase, gelatinase, lactoferrin, plasminogen activator, histaminase, and alkaline phosphatase.\u00a0\nThe larger azurophil (or primary) granules contain MPO, bactericidal factors (such as defensins), acid hydrolases, and a variety of neutral proteases (elastase, cathepsin G, nonspecific collagenases, proteinase 3).\n\nKumar V, Abbas AK, Aster JC. Robbins basic pathology. Elsevier Health Sciences; 2017. Page 68"
                ],
                "answer": [
                    "Lysozyme"
                ],
                "generated_cot": [
                    {
                        "id": "4d5794c5-7db3-4c68-8fe1-cc806891d6ac",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": null,
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "D) IL6",
                        "answers": [
