                    {
                        "id": "1c2ad7de-0d72-4034-9d43-2ad3eaf0ae0e",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": "qa-10",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Plan:\n1. Understand the meaning of inflammatory mediators.\n2. Identify the inflammatory mediators involved in intracellular killing of microbes.\n3. Match the identified mediators with the given options.\n4. Choose the correct option.\n\nAnswer:\n1. Inflammatory mediators are substances produced by the immune system in response to an infection or injury. They help in the recruitment of immune cells to the site of infection or injury and aid in the destruction of pathogens.\n2. Intracellular killing of microbes involves the destruction of pathogens within the cells of the immune system. This process is carried out by various mechanisms, including the production of reactive oxygen species (ROS) and the release of lysosomal enzymes.\n3. Matching the identified mediators with the given options:\n- Catalase: Catalase is an enzyme that breaks down hydrogen peroxide into water and oxygen. It is not directly involved in intracellular killing of microbes.\n- Oxidase: Oxidase is an enzyme that catalyzes the transfer of electrons from a substrate to oxygen, producing hydrogen peroxide. It is involved in the production of ROS, which can kill microbes intracellularly.\n- Lysozyme: Lysozyme is an enzyme that breaks down the cell walls of bacteria. It is involved in the destruction of pathogens within lysosomes.\n- IL6: Interleukin-6 (IL6) is a cytokine that plays a role in inflammation and immune response. It is not directly involved in intracellular killing of microbes.\n4. The correct option is B) Oxidase.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "d8c9b67a-25b1-42d6-9847-3318c56f2013",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
