                        "cot": "My plan for how to get to the right answer is as follows:\n\nStep 1: Assess the situation\nUpon receiving an unresponsive patient from the police, the first thing I will do is assess the situation. I will quickly scan the patient for any obvious signs of injury or trauma, such as bleeding, broken bones, or burns. I will also check for any medical alert bracelets or necklaces that may provide important information about the patient's medical history.\n\nStep 2: Check for response\nThe next step is to check for response. I will gently shake the patient and call out their name to see if they respond. If there is no response, I will try to elicit a response by applying pressure to the patient's nail bed or rubbing their sternum.\n\nStep 3: Call for help\nIf the patient does not respond, I will call for help. I will ask someone to call 911 or the emergency medical services (EMS) and request an ambulance. If there is no one around, I will call for help myself.\n\nStep 4: Check for breathing and pulse\nWhile waiting for help to arrive, I will check for breathing and pulse. I will place my ear close to the patient's mouth and nose to listen for breathing sounds. I will also check for a carotid pulse by placing two fingers on the patient's neck, just below the jawline.\n\nStep 5: Begin CPR if necessary\nIf the patient is not breathing and has no pulse, I will begin CPR. I will start with chest compressions, followed by rescue breaths. I will continue CPR until help arrives or the patient starts breathing and has a pulse.\n\nBased on this plan, the correct answer to the question is C) Check for response and call help.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "e9fce001-ddde-44c7-ada3-daa1f36bd175",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "C) Check for response and call help.",
                                "correct_answer": false
                            }
                        ],
