                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What is the condition of the pond in the man's backyard after a week of heavy rain?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n\n1. The man had a pond in his backyard.\n2. There was a week of heavy rain.\n3. We need to determine the condition of the pond after the rain.\n4. Option A, \"melted,\" doesn't make sense because ponds don't melt.\n5. Option B, \"dehydrated,\" also doesn't make sense because the pond would have more water, not less, after heavy rain.\n6. Option C, \"bloated,\" seems like a possibility because the pond could have filled up with excess water.\n7. Option D, \"salted,\" doesn't make sense because there is no indication that salt was added to the pond.\n8. Therefore, the correct answer is C) bloated.\n\nAnswer: C) bloated.",
