                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Plan:\n1. Understand the question and the options provided.\n2. Recall the concept of brightness and how it is affected by distance.\n3. Analyze each option and determine which one fits the concept of brightness and distance.\n\nAnswer: \nThe correct option is C) the moon is brighter than a floodlight. This is because the moon reflects sunlight and is relatively close to Earth, making it appear brighter than a floodlight which is a man-made source of light and is usually not as bright as the moon. The sun being always bright is not relevant to the question, and option B and D are incorrect as they do not relate to the concept of brightness and distance.",
