                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Which of the following instances may cause light from further away to appear less bright than other, closer sources?\n\nA) The sun is always bright, so this instance does not apply.\nB) The moon is brighter than stars, so this instance does not apply.\nC) The moon is brighter than a floodlight, so this instance does not apply.\nD) The sun is darker than the moon, so this instance may cause light from further away to appear less bright than the moon. \n\nTherefore, the correct answer is D) the sun is darker than the moon.",
