                        "cot": "Plan:\n1. Identify what happens when a drum is banged.\n2. Determine which option best describes the identified outcome.\n3. Choose the correct answer.\n\nAnswer: \n1. When a drum is banged, it produces sound waves that travel through the air.\n2. Option C, reverberations to strike the eardrum, best describes the outcome of banging on a drum as it accurately describes how the sound waves produced by the drum reach our ears.\n3. Therefore, the correct answer is C) reverberations to strike the eardrum.",
