                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\n1. When did humans evolve? \n- Humans evolved around 200,000 years ago.\n\n2. When were fossil fuels formed? \n- Fossil fuels were formed over millions of years from the remains of dead plants and animals that were buried and subjected to heat and pressure. The process began around 300 million years ago.\n\n3. Therefore, were there fossil fuels in the ground when humans evolved? \n- Yes, there were significant supplies of fossil fuels that had accumulated prior to human evolution. \n\nAnswer: C) significant supplies accumulated prior.",
