                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "The answer is C) electricity.\n\nExplanation:\n\n1. The question is asking for a useful product that can be made from moving winds.\n2. Wood and metal are not products that can be made from moving winds.\n3. Bananas are a fruit and cannot be made from moving winds.\n4. Electricity can be generated from moving winds through the use of wind turbines.\n5. Therefore, the correct answer is C) electricity.",
