                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Additional knowledge: Moving winds can be harnessed to generate energy.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. How can moving winds be harnessed?\n2. What type of energy can be generated from moving winds?\n3. What products can be made from the energy generated by moving winds?\n\nAnswers:\n1. Moving winds can be harnessed through the use of wind turbines. \n2. Electricity can be generated from moving winds. \n3. Useful products that can be made from the energy generated by moving winds include powering homes and businesses, charging electric vehicles, and powering streetlights. Therefore, the answer to the original question is C) electricity.",
