                        "cot": "Rephrased question: Which of the following actions involve muscles moving bones to produce movement?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n- Option A, \"arms are resting,\" does not involve any movement, so it cannot be the correct answer.\n- Option B, \"hair is growing,\" is a biological process that does not involve muscles or bones, so it cannot be the correct answer.\n- Option C, \"smiles are invisible,\" does not involve movement of bones, so it cannot be the correct answer.\n- Option D, \"toes are wiggled,\" involves muscles in the feet contracting and relaxing to move the bones in the toes, so this is the correct answer.\n\nAnswer: D) toes are wiggled.",
