                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStep 1: What is the life work of a flower?\n\nThe life work of a flower refers to the purpose or function of a flower during its life cycle.\n\nStep 2: What are the functions of a flower?\n\nThe functions of a flower include attracting pollinators, producing seeds, and reproducing.\n\nStep 3: Which of the options provided aligns with the functions of a flower?\n\nOption B, \"be successfully fertilized,\" aligns with the functions of a flower as it refers to the production of seeds and reproduction. Therefore, the correct answer is B) be successfully fertilized.",
